 </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-4-1-2-2\">\n                                Каталог уже готов к работе. Добавьте профиль, чтобы бренды могли находить вас.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#FF8167] px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-4-2\" href=\"/onboarding\">\n                        Зарегистрироваться\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FFE878] px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-24\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"business call to action section\" id=\"business\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full border-[28px] border-[#FF8167]/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"decorative circle\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[38%] h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-[#72E4FF] shadow-[12px_12px_0_#1769FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"decorative blob\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[1220px] flex-col gap-7 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-1-1\">\n                        Для команд\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[680px] font-['Outfit'] text-[42px] font-extrabold leading-[.98] tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-1-2\">\n                        Меньше поиска. Больше сделок, которые можно измерить.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-[12px] bg-[#0F172A] px-5 py-3.5 text-[12px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-2\" href=\"#matcher\">\n                    Собрать кампанию\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-3-2-1\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:15px;line-height:1\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-[#E8F1FF] px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"influencer call to action section\" id=\"influencers\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1220px] flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#1769FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\">\n                        Для авторов\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-4 font-['Outfit'] text-[34px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\">\n                        Ваш профиль — следующая сильная коллаборация.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[620px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3\">\n                        Зарегистрируйтесь один раз, покажите реальные метрики и получайте предложения от бизнеса.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-[12px] border border-[#1769FF] bg-white px-5 py-3 text-[12px] font-extrabold text-[#1769FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\" href=\"/onboarding\">\n                    Стать инфлюенсером\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\" style=\"color:#1769FF;font-size:15px;line-height:1\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-5 py-10 md:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1220px] flex-col gap-7 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                <a class=\"font-['Outfit'] text-[25px] font-extrabold italic tracking-[-0.08em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" href=\"#top\">\n                    Jeli\n                    <span class=\"text-[#1769FF]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\">\n                        .\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-md text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                    AI-платформа инфлюенс-маркетинга в Казахстане. Прямые кампании, реальные профили и прозрачная защита сделок.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[10px] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">\n                    © 2026 Jeli Platform\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" href=\"#how-it-works\">\n                    Как работает\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" href=\"#business\">\n                    Бизнесу\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\" href=\"#influencers\">\n                    Инфлюенсерам\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-4\" href=\"#catalog\">\n                    Каталог\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-5\" href=\"/terms\">\n                    Условия\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-6\" href=\"/privacy\">\n                    Конфиденциальность\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-7\" data-name=\"footer cookie link\" href=\"/cookies\">\n                    Cookie\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-4 mt-4 flex w-[min(360px,calc(100vw-2rem))] items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-[12px] border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[11px] text-slate-600 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(15,23,42,.12)] md:mr-6\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"cookie banner container\">\n        <p data-kid=\"1-4-1\">\n            Используем необходимые cookie для входа и защиты сессии.\n            <a class=\"font-extrabold text-[#1769FF] underline underline-offset-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" href=\"/cookies\">\n                Подробнее\n            </a>\n        </p>\n        <button class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[9px] bg-[#1769FF] px-3.5 py-2 text-[11px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"dismiss cookie button\" type=\"button\">\n            Понятно\n        </button>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    window.addEventListener('load', function () {\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n    var intro = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } });\n    intro.from('.motion-header', { autoAlpha: 0, y: -18, duration: .45 })\n      .from('.hero-copy', { autoAlpha: 0, x: -36, duration: .75 }, '-=.15')\n      .from('.matcher-panel', { autoAlpha: 0, x: 42, y: 18, duration: .8 }, '-=.45')\n      .from('.art-orbit', { autoAlpha: 0, scale: .7, rotation: -18, duration: 1.1 }, '-=.65');\n    gsap.to('.orbit-ring', { rotation: 380, duration: 26, repeat: -1, ease: 'none' });\n    gsap.to('.orbit-ring.two', { rotation: -360, duration: 34, repeat: -1, ease: 'none' });\n    gsap.to('.orbit-ring.three', { rotation: 360, duration: 22, repeat: -1, ease: 'none' });\n    gsap.to('.floating-orb-a', { y: -18, x: 12, rotation: 18, duration: 2.8, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n    gsap.to('.floating-orb-b', { y: 24, x: -8, duration: 3.4, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n    gsap.to('.floating-orb-c', { y: -15, rotation: 10, duration: 2.6, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n    gsap.to('.floating-orb-d', { y: 18, x: -12, rotation: -12, duration: 3.2, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n    gsap.to('.mesh-field', { backgroundPosition: '76% 64%', ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.hero', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 } });\n    gsap.to('.art-orbit', { yPercent: -32, xPercent: 7, rotation: 18, scale: 1.08, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.hero', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1.2 } });\n    gsap.from('.reveal-section', { y: 42, duration: .7, scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.reveal-section', start: 'top 78%', toggleActions: 'play none none reverse' } });\n    gsap.from('.step-line', { scaleX: 0, duration: .9, ease: 'power2.out', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.step-line', start: 'top 78%', toggleActions: 'play none none reverse' } });\n    gsap.to('.motion-blob', { xPercent: 40, yPercent: -22, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.motion-story', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 } });\n    gsap.to('.motion-blob-two', { xPercent: -35, yPercent: 18, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.motion-story', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 } });\n    gsap.to('.world-object', { rotation: 22, scale: 1.12, yPercent: -10, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.motion-story', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1.2 } });\n    gsap.to('.world-orbit', { rotation: 360, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.motion-story', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 } });\n    gsap.to('.world-orbit-two', { rotation: -260, ease: 'none', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.motion-story', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 } });\n    gsap.from('.signal-card', { scale: .7, stagger: .12, duration: .55, ease: 'back.out(1.4)', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.world-stage', start: 'top 72%', toggleActions: 'play none none reverse' } });\n    gsap.from('.catalog-row', { x: 28, stagger: .1, duration: .5, ease: 'power3.out', scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.catalog-row', start: 'top 82%', toggleActions: 'play none none reverse' } });\n  });\n</script>\n",
